 "how_it_plays": "3 random cabinets (of 4) scroll in 4 px every 3 ticks (49 ms) with sound call 0x0e1, each carrying an award icon: 2 random decoys and the chosen award. Then 0x0e1 stops, 0x0e3 plays and the chosen award's icon alternates icon_a/icon_b every 3 ticks (49 ms) for 21 to 61 steps. Award names come from the ROM audits (0x5b-0x66); the pick weights are not verified."
